#: ../developer/development.md:1
msgid "Developer guide"
msgstr "开发者指南"

#: ../developer/development.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide will help you get a checkout running, find the code that owns "
"your change, and choose the right checks for it. Start with "
"[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for the repository rules and "
"[CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) for the pull-request workflow. "
"For an overview of the product and its deployment topology, see the "
"[README](../../README.md)."
msgstr ""
"这份指南带你把本地仓库跑起来，找到你的改动该落在哪段代码里，并为它选对要跑的检查。仓库规则先看 "
"[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)，pull request 流程见 "
"[CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md)。想先了解产品和部署架构，可以看 "
"[README](../../README.md)。"

#: ../developer/development.md:10
msgid "Set up a checkout"
msgstr "准备本地仓库"

#: ../developer/development.md:12
msgid ""
"Run backend commands from the repository root. Make sure you have Python "
"3.12 and [`uv`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) installed, then create the "
"environment:"
msgstr ""
"后端命令都在仓库根目录下运行。先装好 Python 3.12 和 "
"[`uv`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)，然后创建环境："

#: ../developer/development.md:20
msgid ""
"`make setup-dev` creates `.venv`, then uses `uv sync` to install the "
"project and its development dependencies. It defaults to Python 3.12, "
"which is also the version used in CI; the project supports both Python "
"3.12 and 3.13. When you run Python tools from this checkout, use `uv "
"run`. Package discovery already includes `apps/backend/`, so you do not "
"need to set `PYTHONPATH` for each package."
msgstr ""
"`make setup-dev` 会创建 `.venv`，再用 `uv sync` 安装项目和开发依赖。默认用 Python 3.12，和 CI "
"一致；项目同时支持 3.12 和 3.13。在这个仓库里跑 Python 工具时，用 `uv run`。包发现已经把 "
"`apps/backend/` 包含进去了，不需要为每个包单独设置 `PYTHONPATH`。"

#: ../developer/development.md:27
msgid ""
"If you are working on the frontend, use Node.js 22 to match CI and "
"install the locked dependencies:"
msgstr "如果你要改前端，请用和 CI 一样的 Node.js 22，并安装锁定版本的依赖："

#: ../developer/development.md:35
msgid ""
"When you need to exercise sign-in, migrations, host enrollment, and real "
"Agent CLIs together, use the [complete local Docker "
"stack](../../deploy/local/README.md). Run it from the repository root:"
msgstr ""
"如果要把登录、迁移、主机注册和真实的 Agent CLI 放在一起实际跑一遍，就用[完整的本地 Docker "
"环境](../../deploy/local/README.md)。在仓库根目录运行："

#: ../developer/development.md:45
msgid ""
"The local-stack guide covers Docker prerequisites, ports, logs, "
"stop/resume, and running multiple isolated checkouts."
msgstr "本地环境指南里讲了 Docker 的前置条件、端口、日志、停止和恢复，以及怎样同时跑多份互不干扰的仓库副本。"

#: ../developer/development.md:48
msgid "Find the code that owns a change"
msgstr "找到改动该落在哪里"

#: ../developer/development.md:50
msgid ""
"The backend is split into three installed packages under `apps/backend/`."
" Choose the package based on who should own the behavior you are "
"changing:"
msgstr "后端在 `apps/backend/` 下分成三个可安装的包。你要改的行为该由谁负责，就改哪个包："

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Package"
msgstr "包"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Owns"
msgstr "负责的内容"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "[`cloud_agent/`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent/)"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid ""
"Control plane: HTTP APIs, admission and scheduling, persistence, Gateway "
"adapters, and publication."
msgstr "控制平面：HTTP API、准入与调度、持久化、网关适配器以及发布。"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "[`cloud_agent_host/`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent_host/)"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid ""
"Host execution: claims, retained sandboxes, workspace/session sandbox "
"manager, and Agent CLI adapters."
msgstr "主机端执行：认领任务、保留沙箱、负责工作区和会话的 sandbox manager，以及 Agent CLI 适配器。"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "[`cloud_agent_shared/`](../../apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/)"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid ""
"Protocol versions, capability names, shared payloads and errors, "
"profiling collection, and shared Git/archive algorithms."
msgstr "协议版本、能力名称、共用的数据结构和错误、性能剖析采集，以及共用的 Git 和归档算法。"

#: ../developer/development.md:59
msgid ""
"Inside the control plane, look in `api/` for HTTP handlers, "
"`application/` for reusable flows, `ports/` for persistence interfaces, "
"and `storage/` for their database implementations. Background maintenance"
" and reconciliation belong in `workers/`. Resource construction and "
"lifecycle behavior belong in `bootstrap/`. Finally, `app.py` assembles "
"the main API and the separate MCP-only listener. The [code structure "
"guide](code-structure.md) maps the schema domains, runtime adapters, "
"shared profiling, frontend API clients, and job-detail UI."
msgstr ""
"控制平面内部：HTTP 处理函数在 `api/`，可复用的业务流程在 `application/`，持久化接口在 "
"`ports/`，接口对应的数据库实现在 `storage/`。后台维护和状态调和放在 `workers/`，资源的创建和生命周期管理放在 "
"`bootstrap/`。最后由 `app.py` 把主 API 和单独的 MCP 专用监听器组装起来。[代码结构指南](code-"
"structure.md)更细地梳理了 schema 领域、运行时适配器、共用的性能剖析、前端 API 客户端和任务详情界面。"

#: ../developer/development.md:67
msgid ""
"For common changes, start with the files below. Backend paths in this "
"table are relative to `apps/backend/`."
msgstr "常见的改动可以从下表中的文件入手。表里的后端路径都相对于 `apps/backend/`。"

