msgid ""
"`cloud_agent/api/jobs.py`, `catalog.py`, `turns.py`, or `threads.py`. "
"`api/routes.py` mounts every agent surface listed in `SURFACE_ROUTERS`."
msgstr ""
"`cloud_agent/api/jobs.py`、`catalog.py`、`turns.py` 或 "
"`threads.py`。`SURFACE_ROUTERS` 里列出的每个 agent 接口，都由 `api/routes.py` 统一挂载。"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Request or response validation"
msgstr "请求或响应校验"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid ""
