"`cloud_agent.schemas`."
msgstr "`cloud_agent/schemas/` 里对应的模块；对外导入统一用 `cloud_agent.schemas`。"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "A new caller of task creation"
msgstr "新增一处创建任务的调用"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid ""
"`cloud_agent/application/job_admission.py`; `api/service_jobs.py` is an "
"existing caller."
msgstr ""
"`cloud_agent/application/job_admission.py`；可以参考已有的调用方 "
"`api/service_jobs.py`。"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Workspace files, terminals, or Git views"
msgstr "工作区文件、终端或 Git 视图"

