msgid ""
"`cloud_agent/api/workspace.py` and `sandbox_manager_client.py`; host "
"handling is in `cloud_agent_host/sandbox_manager.py`."
msgstr ""
"`cloud_agent/api/workspace.py` 和 `sandbox_manager_client.py`；主机端的处理在 "
