#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Compute-resource lifecycle"
msgstr "计算资源生命周期"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid ""
"`cloud_agent/application/compute_resources.py`, `compute_reconcile.py`, "
"`workers/compute_resources.py`, and `providers/compute/`."
msgstr ""
"`cloud_agent/application/compute_resources.py`、`compute_reconcile.py`、`workers/compute_resources.py`"
