"`shared_protocol.py`，镜像里的版本固定在 `deploy/sandbox/Dockerfile.agent-sandbox`。"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid "Browser UI or a BFF route"
msgstr "浏览器界面或 BFF 路由"

#: ../developer/development.md
msgid ""
"`apps/frontend/src/`; browser API clients are in `src/lib/api/agents/`, "
"job-page components and hooks in `components/features/agents/job-"
"detail/`."
msgstr ""
"`apps/frontend/src/`。浏览器端的 API 客户端在 `src/lib/api/agents/`，任务页面的组件和 hook 在"
" `components/features/agents/job-detail/`。"

#: ../developer/development.md:83
msgid ""
"Keep your change in the module that owns the behavior. Extract a flow "
"when it needs an independent test boundary, or extract a rule when "
"multiple entry points share it."
msgstr "改动要放在负责这项行为的模块里。一段流程需要单独测试时，再把它抽出来；一条规则被多个入口共用时，再把规则抽出来。"

#: ../developer/development.md:87
msgid "Keep the dependency boundaries"
msgstr "守住依赖边界"

#: ../developer/development.md:89
msgid ""
"The deployment images ship different packages, so an import that works in"
" a checkout can still fail in production. Follow these boundaries:"
msgstr "不同的部署镜像里装的包不一样，所以一个导入在本地仓库里没问题，到了生产环境照样可能失败。请遵守下面这些边界："

#: ../developer/development.md:92
msgid ""
"HTTP adapters call application flows and the storage capabilities they "
"need. Application flows and workers must not import route modules. Some "
"application flows use FastAPI's `HTTPException`; follow the actual "
"interfaces rather than assuming that package is framework-independent."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 适配器调用应用流程，以及流程需要的存储能力。应用流程和 worker 不能导入路由模块。有些应用流程用到了 FastAPI 的 "
"`HTTPException`，所以别想当然地认为这个包和框架无关，以实际的接口为准。"

#: ../developer/development.md:96
msgid ""
"`ports/` defines capabilities without importing their implementations. "
"`Depends(get_storage)` returns the `Storage` assembly: use the surface's "
"narrow protocol and call a capability such as `store.audit` or "
"`store.host_pool`. Repository methods belong to those capabilities."
msgstr ""
"`ports/` 只定义能力，不导入能力的实现。`Depends(get_storage)` 返回组装好的 "
"`Storage`：使用这个接口面对应的窄协议，调用 `store.audit`、`store.host_pool` "
"这样的能力。Repository 方法都归属于这些能力。"

#: ../developer/development.md:100
msgid ""
"The host must not import the control plane, and the shared package must "
"import neither implementation package. Shared Git subprocess and archive "
"I/O belongs in `cloud_agent_shared/git/`. The only other shared code that"
" may import a process, network or background-thread module is the "
"operation-profiling collector. The import-boundary tests list each "
"exemption and the modules it covers."
msgstr ""
"主机端不能导入控制平面，共用包也不能导入这两个实现包中的任何一个。共用的 Git 子进程和归档 I/O 放在 "
"`cloud_agent_shared/git/`。除此之外，共用代码里只有操作性能剖析采集器可以导入进程、网络或后台线程相关的模块。导入边界测试里列出了每一项豁免，以及它覆盖哪些模块。"

#: ../developer/development.md:106
msgid ""
"The control plane must not import the host implementation. Runtime "
"discovery facts live in `cloud_agent_shared/runtime_catalog.py`; host "
"adapters and the control plane both consume them. The [import-boundary "
"tests](../../tests/unit/test_import_boundary.py) enforce both directions "
"of the service boundary."
msgstr ""
"控制平面不能导入主机端的实现。运行时的发现信息放在 "
"`cloud_agent_shared/runtime_catalog.py`，主机适配器和控制平面都从这里读取。[导入边界测试](../../tests/unit/test_import_boundary.py)会从两个方向检查这条服务边界。"

#: ../developer/development.md:111
msgid ""
"The Gateway is reached over HTTP only. Use the contracts in "
"`gateway_contracts/`; do not import `serving.*`, access the Gateway "
"database, or use its `API_KEY_SECRET` or `JWT_SECRET_KEY`. This service "
"uses its own `AGENT_CONTROL_TOKEN_SECRET` and `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`."
msgstr ""
"访问网关只能走 HTTP。请使用 `gateway_contracts/` 里的契约；不要导入 "
"`serving.*`，不要直接访问网关的数据库，也不要使用网关的 `API_KEY_SECRET` 或 "
"`JWT_SECRET_KEY`。本服务有自己的 `AGENT_CONTROL_TOKEN_SECRET` 和 "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`。"

#: ../developer/development.md:116
msgid ""
"Bootstrap owns cross-component wiring. MCP session lifecycle lives in "
"`mcp/runtime.py`, and eager send-now handoff task lifecycle lives in "
"`application/send_now.py`. Bootstrap, application flows, workers, and "
"domain modules must not import HTTP route modules. Domain rules and ports"
" must not import storage implementations or HTTP frameworks. Callers "
"outside storage must not import `storage/repositories/`; shared policies "
"belong to their domain or owning service."
msgstr ""
"跨组件的接线由 bootstrap 负责。MCP 会话的生命周期在 `mcp/runtime.py`，立即发送（send-"
"now）交接任务的生命周期在 `application/send_now.py`。bootstrap、应用流程、worker 和领域模块都不能导入"
" HTTP 路由模块；领域规则和 port 不能导入存储实现或 HTTP 框架；storage 以外的代码不能导入 "
"`storage/repositories/`。共用的策略应该放在它所属的领域，或者负责它的服务里。"

#: ../developer/development.md:124
msgid ""
"Changes to sandbox networking, credential scope, or isolation also need "
"review against [the security boundaries in AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#7"
"-security-boundaries--do-not-relax-without-review). Keep MCP tool calls "
"on the MCP-only listener and long-lived credentials out of sandboxes. "
"Inference spend remains subject to Gateway per-user quota; there is no "
"per-task dollar budget."
msgstr ""
"改动沙箱网络、凭据范围或隔离方式时，还要对照 [AGENTS.md 里的安全边界](../../AGENTS.md#7-security-"
"boundaries--do-not-relax-without-review)做评审。MCP 工具调用只能走 MCP "
"专用监听器，长期凭据不能进沙箱。推理费用仍然受网关的每用户配额约束，没有按任务设的美元预算。"

