#: ../developer/development.md:155
msgid "Run CI locally"
msgstr "在本地跑 CI"

#: ../developer/development.md:157
msgid ""
"The portable launcher runs the backend, database, and frontend gates with"
" check-only formatting and linting:"
msgstr "这个可移植的启动脚本会把后端、数据库和前端的检查都跑一遍，格式化和 lint 只检查、不改文件："

#: ../developer/development.md:168
msgid ""
"Install `uv` and Python 3.12 before running backend or database checks. "
"Frontend checks require Node.js 22 and npm; database checks require a "
"running Docker daemon. The launcher synchronizes locked dependencies with"
" `uv sync --locked` and `npm ci`, and uses the installed runtimes. Like "
"CI, it fails when `uv.lock` no longer matches `pyproject.toml`; run `uv "
"lock` and commit the result. Direct invocation works from any directory: "
"`./scripts/ci-local.sh [all|backend|database|frontend]` from the "
"checkout, or its absolute path elsewhere. The default tier is `all`."
msgstr ""
"跑后端或数据库检查前，先装好 `uv` 和 Python 3.12。前端检查需要 Node.js 22 和 npm，数据库检查需要 Docker "
"守护进程在运行。启动脚本会用 `uv sync --locked` 和 `npm ci` 同步锁定的依赖，并使用本机已装的运行时。和 CI "
"一样，`uv.lock` 与 `pyproject.toml` 对不上时它会失败，这时运行 `uv lock` "
"并提交结果。脚本可以在任何目录下直接调用：在仓库里用 `./scripts/ci-local.sh "
"[all|backend|database|frontend]`，在别处用它的绝对路径。默认的层级是 `all`。"

#: ../developer/development.md:177
msgid ""
"Backend checks run Ruff formatting and lint checks, pydocstyle, mypy, and"
" pytest with four workers and `--dist loadfile`, excluding `external` and"
" `dbtest`. The database tier starts a fresh PostgreSQL 15 container on a "
"random loopback port, creates separate databases for all four workers, "
"and removes the container on exit or interruption. It rejects a database "
"run with skipped tests or fewer than 100 tests. Frontend checks run lint,"
" format check, type-check, tests, and both server-only and runtime-site-"
"config build guards."
msgstr ""
"后端检查包括 Ruff 格式和 lint 检查、pydocstyle、mypy，以及用四个 worker 和 `--dist loadfile` "
"跑的 pytest（不含 `external` 和 `dbtest`）。数据库层级会在一个随机的回环端口上新起一个 PostgreSQL 15 "
"容器，给四个 worker 各建一个数据库，退出或被中断时删除容器。只要有测试被跳过，或者测试总数不到 100 个，这一层就不算通过。前端检查包括"
" lint、格式检查、类型检查、测试，以及 server-only 和运行时站点配置这两项构建守卫。"

#: ../developer/development.md:185
msgid ""
"Each run saves logs in a fresh gitignored `.local-ci/<tier>.XXXXXX` "
"directory. Set `CI_LOG_DIR` to choose an output directory. This local "
"gate excludes external regressions, rolling upgrades, Gitleaks, Docker "
"release-image builds, and Kata qualification; those remain part of the "
"wider hosted CI gate."
msgstr ""
"每次运行都会把日志存进一个新建的 `.local-ci/<tier>.XXXXXX` 目录，这个目录已被 git 忽略。想换输出位置，就设置 "
"`CI_LOG_DIR`。本地检查不包括外部回归测试、滚动升级、Gitleaks、Docker 发布镜像构建和 Kata 资格验证，这些仍由托管 "
"CI 负责。"

#: ../developer/development.md:190
msgid ""
"Every pull request, from a fork or from a branch of this repository, runs"
" on disposable GitHub-hosted VMs: ARM64 artifacts use `ubuntu-24.04-arm`,"
" and everything else uses `ubuntu-24.04`. The repository is public, so "
"these runners consume no minute quota. Pushes to `dev` and `main`, and "
"authorized manual dispatches, keep the self-hosted pools, which also run "
"publication and synchronization. Every PR has only a read token, checkout"
" does not persist it, image jobs use anonymous registry pulls, and no PR "
"job receives a secret. Release publication shares no builder with any of "
"them: each publish cell creates a fresh builder under its own "
"`RUNNER_TEMP` and removes it when the job ends. The only layers a release"
" reuses come from its own registry cache, a `buildcache-<artifact>-<ISO "
"week>` tag in the artifact's package that only the publish workflow "
"writes; it is renamed weekly, so the first release of each week builds "
"cold. Real Kata host qualification remains excluded from every PR and "
"runs only on trusted `dev` events."
msgstr ""
"每个 pull request，不管来自 fork 还是本仓库的分支，都在用完即弃的 GitHub 托管虚拟机上运行：ARM64 产物用 "
"`ubuntu-24.04-arm`，其余都用 `ubuntu-24.04`。仓库是公开的，这些 runner 不占分钟配额。推送到 `dev` "
"和 `main`、以及经过授权的手动触发，仍然使用自托管的 runner 池，发布和同步也在这些池上跑。PR "
"拿到的只有一个只读令牌，checkout 不会把它保存下来，镜像任务从镜像仓库匿名拉取，所有 PR 任务都拿不到 "
"secret。发布不和其中任何一个共用构建器：每个发布单元都在自己的 `RUNNER_TEMP` "
"下新建构建器，任务结束就删掉。发布唯一会复用的层来自它自己的镜像仓库缓存，也就是产物包里的 `buildcache-<artifact>-<ISO"
" week>` 标签，只有发布工作流会写它。这个标签每周换一次名，所以每周的第一次发布都是冷构建。真实 Kata 主机的资格验证不会在任何 PR "
"里跑，只在受信任的 `dev` 事件上运行。"

#: ../developer/development.md:206
msgid ""
"Pull requests only read the Actions cache. After each push to `dev`, the "
"optional `pr-caches.yml` workflow fills the uv and npm caches and exports"
" the sandbox image's build layers from a hosted VM, under the `dev` scope"
" that every pull request into `dev` may restore. It runs separately from "
"CI, so publication does not wait for it and its failure does not affect "
"CI's conclusion. Of the 15 real-CLI MCP cases, a pull request runs Kilo's"
" three as `MCP conformance (kilo, …)` jobs, one case each, and the other "
"twelve in the sandbox image job; trusted events run all 15 in the sandbox"
" image job."
msgstr ""
"pull request 只读取 Actions 缓存，不写入。每次推送到 `dev` 后，可选的 `pr-caches.yml` "
"工作流会在一台托管虚拟机上填好 uv 和 npm 缓存，并导出沙箱镜像的构建层，存在 `dev` 作用域下，所有合入 `dev` 的 pull "
"request 都能恢复使用。它和 CI 分开运行：发布不用等它，它失败了也不影响 CI 的结果。真实 CLI 的 MCP 用例共 15 "
"个：pull request 中，Kilo 的三个各自单独作为一个 `MCP conformance (kilo, …)` "
"任务运行，其余十二个放在沙箱镜像任务里；受信任的事件则把 15 个都放在沙箱镜像任务里跑。"

#: ../developer/development.md:215
msgid ""
"A pull request also splits the default test tier, the PostgreSQL tier, "
"and the frontend unit tests over two hosted VMs each, shown as `Tests "
"(1/2)` and so on. `scripts/ci_shard.py` deals whole test files to the "
"pytest shards, and vitest splits its own with `--shard`. Trusted events "
"run each tier as a single shard. To run one shard locally, pass its files"
" to pytest:"
msgstr ""
"pull request 还会把默认测试层级、PostgreSQL 层级和前端单元测试各拆到两台托管虚拟机上，显示为 `Tests (1/2)` "
"这样的名字。pytest 由 `scripts/ci_shard.py` 按整个文件分配到各个分片，vitest 则用 `--shard` "
"自己拆分。受信任的事件每个层级只跑一个分片。想在本地跑某一个分片，把它分到的文件传给 pytest："

#: ../developer/development.md:226
msgid ""
"GitHub issue [#464](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference-"
"cloud-agent/issues/464) tracks the remaining administrator work: the "
"runner-group controls below, validated against an untrusted fork."
msgstr ""
"剩下需要管理员完成的工作记录在 GitHub issue [#464](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys"
"/hybridInference-cloud-agent/issues/464)：配置下面说的 runner 组限制，并用一个不受信任的 fork"
" 验证。"

#: ../developer/development.md:230
msgid ""
"Because the repository is public, a fork's pull request can run "
"workflows. Configure GitHub's runner groups to allow persistent pools "
"only for the trusted workflow references on `refs/heads/dev` and "
"`refs/heads/main`, including the publication and manual synchronization "
"workflows. The pools are registered on the repository today, where no "
"such restriction applies, so they need to move into an organization "
"runner group first. Deny PR merge/head refs and other workflow files. "
"Until then, require approval for fork workflows from every external "
"contributor, not only first-time ones. Verify those rules with an "
"untrusted fork workflow edit that requests a persistent runner: it must "
"remain ineligible. A fork can edit its workflow YAML, so the checked-in "
"runner expressions cannot enforce this restriction themselves. If the "
"organization cannot restrict runner groups by workflow reference, remove "
"these persistent runners from the repository's eligible groups and run "
"trusted CI/publication in a separate restricted repository, or replace "
"them with credential-free single-job disposable runners. Fork approval "
"settings alone are insufficient: allowing a test run must never grant "
"access to publication's hosts or credentials. These are GitHub "
"administrator settings; repository tests cannot configure or verify them."
msgstr ""
"因为仓库是公开的，fork 发来的 pull request 也能运行工作流。所以要配置 GitHub 的 runner 组，让持久化的 "
"runner 池只能被 `refs/heads/dev` 和 `refs/heads/main` "
"上受信任的工作流引用使用，其中包括发布和手动同步工作流；PR 的 merge/head "
"引用和其他工作流文件一律拒绝。这些池目前注册在仓库级别，仓库级别没有这种限制，所以得先把它们挪到组织级的 runner "
"组里。在此之前，所有外部贡献者的 fork 工作流都必须经过批准，而不只是第一次贡献的人。验证方法是：在一个不受信任的 fork "
"里修改工作流，让它申请持久化 runner，结果必须是申请不到。fork 可以随意改自己的工作流 YAML，所以仓库里写的 runner "
"表达式本身拦不住它。如果组织无法按工作流引用限制 runner 组，就把这些持久化 runner 从仓库可用的组里移除，把受信任的 CI "
"和发布放到另一个受限的仓库里跑，或者换成不带凭据、只跑一个任务就销毁的 runner。光靠 fork "
"的批准设置是不够的：批准一次测试运行，绝不能顺带给出发布主机或发布凭据的访问权限。这些都是 GitHub "
"的管理员设置，仓库里的测试既配置不了，也验证不了。"

#: ../developer/development.md:249
msgid ""
"The default backend test tier uses four workers in both CI and `make "
"test`, keeping each test file on one worker. Override the worker count "
"when needed; zero disables parallel execution for debugging:"
msgstr ""
"默认的后端测试层级在 CI 和 `make test` 中都用四个 worker，同一个测试文件始终在同一个 worker 上。需要时可以改 "
"worker 数量；设为零就关闭并行，方便调试："

#: ../developer/development.md:257
msgid ""
"Use markers to select the test tier you need. For example, "
"`tests/servers/` contains HTTP-level tests that do not require a deployed"
" server. Tests marked `external` list their prerequisites in the test "
"module; these may include Docker, a real CLI, or a configured Gateway. CI"
" runs selected external checks in addition to the default tier."
msgstr ""
"用 marker 选择要跑的测试层级。例如 `tests/servers/` 里是 HTTP 层面的测试，不需要真正部署服务器。标了 "
"`external` 的测试会在测试模块里写明前置条件，可能需要 Docker、真实的 CLI 或配置好的网关。除了默认层级，CI "
"还会挑一部分外部检查来跑。"

#: ../developer/development.md:263
msgid ""
"If you change the database, run `make test-db-local`. It needs only "
"Docker. It starts one PostgreSQL 15 container per machine (`cloud-agent-"
"test-postgres` on `127.0.0.1:54339`, with its data in memory), creates "
"empty databases for this checkout, named from its path, and runs the "
"`dbtest` tier with up to twelve workers. Every run starts from empty "
"databases, so one run's data or settings never reach the next, and two "
"worktrees never share tables. Two runs in the same checkout take turns. "
"The run fails if any database test was skipped."
msgstr "如果改了数据库，就跑 `make test-db-local`，只需要 Docker。它在每台机器上起一个 PostgreSQL 15 容器（`cloud-agent-test-postgres`，监听 `127.0.0.1:54339`，数据放在内存里），按仓库副本的路径给它建一套空库，再用最多十二个 worker 跑 `dbtest` 测试层级。每次都从空库开始，所以上一次留下的数据和设置不会带到下一次，两个 worktree 也不会共用表。同一个仓库副本里同时发起两次，会排队依次跑。只要有数据库测试被跳过，这次运行就算失败。"

#: ../developer/development.md:271
msgid ""
"Pass pytest arguments with `ARGS`, for example `make test-db-local "
"ARGS=\"tests/integration/storage/test_team_store.py -x\"`. To run pytest "
"yourself, `eval \"$(scripts/test-db-local.sh env)\"` creates the "
"databases and exports the `TEST_DB_*` values. When you remove a worktree,"
" `make test-db-local-clean` drops its databases. `make test-db-local-"
"down` removes the container and every checkout's databases with it, so do"
" not run it while someone else may be testing."
msgstr "要给 pytest 传参数就用 `ARGS`，例如 `make test-db-local ARGS=\"tests/integration/storage/test_team_store.py -x\"`。想自己跑 pytest，可以先执行 `eval \"$(scripts/test-db-local.sh env)\"`，它会建好库并导出 `TEST_DB_*` 这几个变量。删掉一个 worktree 之后，用 `make test-db-local-clean` 清掉它的库。`make test-db-local-down` 会删掉容器，所有仓库副本的库也跟着一起没了，所以别人可能正在跑测试时不要用它。"

#: ../developer/development.md:279
msgid ""
"To use a PostgreSQL of your own, run `make test-db` against a dedicated "
"test database. Fixtures read `TEST_DB_HOST`, `TEST_DB_PORT`, "
"`TEST_DB_NAME`, `TEST_DB_USER`, and `TEST_DB_PASSWORD`; `TEST_DB_NAME` "
"must contain `_test_`. Check the result for skipped tests, because an "
"unavailable database can cause fixtures to skip rather than fail. "
"Parallel workers need separate pre-created databases. See "
"[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#database) for defaults and worker "
"naming."
msgstr ""
"如果要用你自己的 PostgreSQL，就用一个专门的测试数据库跑 `make test-db`。测试夹具会读取 "
"`TEST_DB_HOST`、`TEST_DB_PORT`、`TEST_DB_NAME`、`TEST_DB_USER` 和 "
"`TEST_DB_PASSWORD`，其中 `TEST_DB_NAME` 必须包含 "
"`_test_`。跑完要看一下有没有被跳过的测试：数据库连不上时，夹具可能直接跳过，而不是报错。并行的 worker "
"各自需要一个事先建好的数据库。默认值和 worker 的命名规则见 "
"[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#database)。"

#: ../developer/development.md:287
msgid ""
"Deployment tests read the sandbox CLI version settings. If your "
"development tool exports a different `CODEX_VERSION`, remove that "
"inherited value for the check:"
msgstr "部署相关的测试会读取沙箱 CLI 的版本设置。如果你的开发工具导出了另一个 `CODEX_VERSION`，跑检查时把这个继承来的变量去掉："

#: ../developer/development.md:295
msgid "For a frontend change, run these checks from the repository root:"
msgstr "改了前端，就在仓库根目录运行下面这些检查："

#: ../developer/development.md:306
msgid ""
"CI also runs the following build guards. Run the relevant one locally "
"when you change server-only imports or runtime site configuration:"
msgstr "CI 还会跑下面两个构建守卫。如果你改了 server-only 导入或运行时站点配置，在本地跑对应的那个："

#: ../developer/development.md:314
msgid "Browser recovery regressions run the production Next.js app in Chromium:"
msgstr "浏览器恢复的回归测试会在 Chromium 里跑生产构建的 Next.js 应用："

#: ../developer/development.md:321
msgid ""
"Run these in an isolated checkout on the test host with Node 22. "
"Chromium's system libraries must be provisioned there; this command does "
"not install OS packages. `PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH` can keep the browser "
"download in that checkout's disposable test directory. The runner builds "
"the root web variant, allocates its own loopback ports, and shuts down "
"its servers afterwards. Do not run another build against the same `.next`"
" directory concurrently."
msgstr ""
"请在测试主机上一份单独的仓库副本里，用 Node 22 运行这些命令。Chromium 依赖的系统库要事先装好，这条命令不会安装系统软件包。可以用"
" `PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH` 把浏览器下载到这份副本里用完即删的测试目录。测试运行器会构建根路径的 Web "
"变体，自己分配回环端口，跑完后关掉它起的服务器。不要同时对同一个 `.next` 目录再跑一次构建。"

#: ../developer/development.md:328
msgid ""
"The tests use real page navigation, browser offline mode, and failed "
"JavaScript chunk downloads. A separate HTTP fixture supplies explicit API"
" responses and delays or truncates responses after recording a creation. "
"Unknown API requests fail the suite. This covers browser recovery and "
"client/API interactions; it does not exercise the Python control plane, "
"database, authentication provider, or sandbox hosts. Those still need "
"their integration and staging checks."
msgstr ""
"这些测试会真实地切换页面、让浏览器离线，并模拟 JavaScript 分块下载失败。另有一个独立的 HTTP 测试桩，按测试的设定返回 API "
"响应，也能在记录下一次创建请求之后故意延迟或截断响应。遇到没有预设的 API "
"请求，整个测试套件直接失败。这些测试覆盖的是浏览器端的恢复，以及客户端和 API 之间的交互；Python "
"控制平面、数据库、身份认证服务和沙箱主机都不在范围内，它们仍然要靠各自的集成测试和 staging 检查。"

#: ../developer/development.md:335
msgid ""
"Chromium aborts requests still waiting for a connection with "
"`net::ERR_NETWORK_CHANGED` whenever the host's network addresses change, "
"which happens on shared CI runners when other jobs start or stop "
"containers. A test whose failed attempt saw that error runs once more and"
" is reported as flaky. The retry after any other failure fails at once, "
"so that failure still fails the suite (`apps/frontend/e2e/network-"
"change.ts`)."
msgstr ""
"主机的网络地址一变，Chromium 就会以 `net::ERR_NETWORK_CHANGED` 中止还在等连接的请求。在共享的 CI "
"runner 上，别的任务启动或停止容器时就会出现这种情况。测试失败的那次尝试如果遇到了这个错误，就会再跑一次，并报告为 "
"flaky。其他原因导致的失败，重试会直接失败，所以这类失败照样会让整个测试套件失败（`apps/frontend/e2e/network-"
"change.ts`）。"

#: ../developer/development.md:342
msgid ""
"Failures retain screenshots and Playwright traces in `apps/frontend/test-"
"results/` and an HTML report in `apps/frontend/playwright-report/`; CI "
"uploads both. To iterate on fixture/spec changes after a successful root "
"build, use `CLOUD_AGENT_E2E_SKIP_BUILD=1 npm run test:browser`. Rebuild "
"after app changes."
msgstr ""
"测试失败时，截图和 Playwright trace 会留在 `apps/frontend/test-results/`，HTML 报告留在 "
"`apps/frontend/playwright-report/`，CI "
"会把两者都上传。根路径构建成功之后，如果只是在改测试桩或测试用例，可以用 `CLOUD_AGENT_E2E_SKIP_BUILD=1 npm "
"run test:browser` 反复跑；改了应用代码就要重新构建。"

#: ../developer/development.md:347
msgid ""
"The `make ci-frontend` target runs the checks above, including browser "
"recovery. Hosted CI also builds and smoke-tests both the root and "
"`/agents` web variants when image changes are selected. See "
"[CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md#continuous-integration) for the "
"wider CI gate."
msgstr ""
"`make ci-frontend` 会跑上面所有检查，浏览器恢复测试也在内。如果改动涉及镜像，托管 CI 还会构建根路径和 `/agents` "
"两个 Web 变体并做冒烟测试。完整的 CI 检查见 [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md"
"#continuous-integration)。"

#: ../developer/development.md:353
msgid "Changing an API"
msgstr "修改 API"

#: ../developer/development.md:355
msgid "`gateway_contracts/` contains two different kinds of HTTP contract:"
msgstr "`gateway_contracts/` 里有两类不同的 HTTP 契约："

#: ../developer/development.md:357
msgid ""
"`*.openapi.yaml` describes the Gateway APIs this service consumes. When a"
" client starts reading a new field or calling a new endpoint, verify the "
"corresponding Gateway source and update the document in the same PR."
msgstr ""
"`*.openapi.yaml` 描述本服务调用的网关 API。客户端开始读取新字段或调用新端点时，要去网关源代码里核实，并在同一个 PR "
"里更新这份文档。"

#: ../developer/development.md:360
msgid ""
"`agent-control-plane.openapi.json` records the API this service "
"publishes. An intentional API change requires a reviewed snapshot update "
"in the same PR."
msgstr ""
"`agent-control-plane.openapi.json` 记录本服务对外提供的 API。有意修改 API 时，要在同一个 PR "
"里更新这份快照，并经过评审。"

#: ../developer/development.md:363
msgid "Regenerate the control-plane snapshot from the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录重新生成控制平面的快照："

#: ../developer/development.md:381
msgid ""
"Review the generated diff and explain any compatibility implications. The"
" surface tests also reject duplicate registrations and overlaps between "
"the agent surface routers. A snapshot update records a change; the "
"behavioral tests and review establish whether it is compatible. The "
"[contract guide](../../gateway_contracts/README.md) explains what these "
"checks can verify and what still needs comparison with Gateway source."
msgstr ""
"仔细看一遍生成的 diff，并说明它对兼容性有什么影响。接口测试还会拦下重复注册，以及 agent "
"接口路由之间的重叠。快照只是记录了改动；改动是否兼容，要靠行为测试和评审来判断。[契约指南](../../gateway_contracts/README.md)讲了这些检查能验证什么，以及哪些地方仍需对照网关源代码确认。"

#: ../developer/development.md:388
msgid "Packaging and documentation"
msgstr "打包与文档"

#: ../developer/development.md:390
msgid ""
"When adding or moving a package, review package discovery in "
"`pyproject.toml`, mypy and linter roots, Docker `COPY` paths, and the "
"path classifier in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`. Verify the built images "
"contain their dependencies; checkout imports alone cannot establish that."
" CI builds and starts selected images, and its classifier tests derive "
"shared package paths from the Dockerfiles."
msgstr ""
"新增或移动包时，要检查 `pyproject.toml` 里的包发现、mypy 和 linter 的根目录、Docker 的 `COPY` "
"路径，以及 `.github/workflows/ci.yml` "
"里的路径分类器。还要确认构建出来的镜像带齐了依赖：本地仓库里能导入，并不能说明镜像里也能。CI 会构建并启动部分镜像，分类器的测试会根据 "
"Dockerfile 推出共用包的路径。"

#: ../developer/development.md:397
msgid ""
"Schema changes use explicit additive Alembic revisions. The current chain"
" starts at `migrations/versions/0001_schema_baseline.py`; keep schema "
"creation out of service startup. There is no SQLAlchemy model metadata "
"for autogeneration. For databases stamped with the pre-baseline chain, "
"follow [the rebuild runbook](operations.md#rebuilding-the-agent-"
"database)."
msgstr ""
"schema 改动要写成显式的增量 Alembic 修订。当前的迁移链从 "
"`migrations/versions/0001_schema_baseline.py` "
"开始；不要在服务启动时建表。项目里没有可供自动生成迁移的 SQLAlchemy 模型元数据。如果数据库还标记着 baseline "
