#: ../developer/development.md:413
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"These guides form the developer documentation site, built with Sphinx and"
" MyST from `docs/developer/`. Add a new guide there and list it in a "
"table of contents in `docs/developer/index.md`. A root-level guide such "
"as `ENVIRONMENT.md` is shown through a one-line `{include}` page "
"registered in `INCLUDED_PAGES` in `docs/developer/conf.py`. Links to "
"other repository files may stay relative: the build points them at "
"GitHub, and fails for a path or heading that does not exist. Run `make "
"docs-verify` after changing any page; CI's Docs Build job runs the same "
"target. The site is also published in Simplified Chinese, so an English "
"edit needs its translation updated too; see [translating the "
"docs](translations.md)."
msgstr ""
"这些指南组成了开发者文档站，用 Sphinx 和 MyST 从 `docs/developer/` 构建。新写的指南放在这个目录下，并加进 "
"`docs/developer/index.md` 里的某个目录树。`ENVIRONMENT.md` 这类放在仓库根目录的指南，通过一个只有一行 "
"`{include}` 的页面展示，这个页面要在 `docs/developer/conf.py` 的 `INCLUDED_PAGES` "
"里注册。指向仓库里其他文件的链接可以继续用相对路径：构建时会把它们换成 GitHub 链接，路径或标题不存在就会报错。改了任何页面都要跑 "
"`make docs-verify`，CI 的 Docs Build "
"任务跑的是同一个目标。本站还发布简体中文版，所以改了英文也要更新对应的译文，见[翻译文档](translations.md)。"

